<div id="A2.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A2.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ B.3 Statistics of Different Perspectives ‣ Appendix B Data Statistics ‣ MIMO: A medical vision language model with visual referring multimodal input and pixel grounding multimodal output" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> shows the statistical results of MIMOSeg, including the number of training, validation, and test sets for each perspective. Since the amount of MIMOSeg data is very large, we divide the training, validation, and test sets in a ratio of 99:0.5:0.5.</p>
</div>
